Detailed Job description:
Required Qualifications
• 5–8 years of professional experience in DevOps, backend engineering, or platform
engineering
• Strong Python skills with real production experience
• Hands-on experience building or maintaining backend services (REST APIs,
microservices)
• Working knowledge of data engineering concepts (ETL, pipelines, data validation)
• Experience with at least one major cloud platform (AWS or Azure)
• Familiarity with CI/CD tooling and release automation
• Experience with Docker and container orchestration (Kubernetes preferred)
• Solid Linux fundamentals and troubleshooting skills
Key Responsibilities
• Design, build, and maintain CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation
(including GitHub
Actions where applicable).
